          "request": {
            "name": "Update Media Storage Configuration",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Associates a <code>SignalingChannel</code> to a stream to store the media. There are two signaling modes that can specified :</p> <ul> <li> <p>If the <code>StorageStatus</code> is disabled, no data will be stored, and the <code>StreamARN</code> parameter will not be needed. </p> </li> <li> <p>If the <code>StorageStatus</code> is enabled, the data will be stored in the <code>StreamARN</code> provided. </p> </li> </ul>",
